{"id":"39ff90695df78ee1","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-faithful-interpretability.md","title":"Pi1 and Sigma1 Characterization","display":"thm-faithful-interpretability — Pi1 and Sigma1 Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-faithful-interpretability","aliases":["67-thm-faithful-interpretability"],"display":"thm-faithful-interpretability — Pi1 and Sigma1 Characterization","depends_on":["[[67-df-faithful-interpretability]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]","[[67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §2，Theorems 13–14，印刷页 84–87；PDF 第 95–98 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"仅核对 Theorem 14 陈述与依赖定位；第 85–87 页忠实 Henkin 构造未逐行核验","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-faithful-interpretability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-faithful-interpretability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-faithful-interpretability — Pi1 and Sigma1 Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"31b7e1fe9d49615e\" href=\"?note=31b7e1fe9d49615e\" title=\"67-df-faithful-interpretability\">67-df-faithful-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b478f37907667f0\" href=\"?note=8b478f37907667f0\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-pi1\">67-thm-interpretability-pi1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5c44edc6c37ffdc\" href=\"?note=f5c44edc6c37ffdc\" title=\"67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion\">67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §2，Theorems 13–14，印刷页 84–87；PDF 第 95–98 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"仅核对 Theorem 14 陈述与依赖定位；第 85–87 页忠实 Henkin 构造未逐行核验"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq A\\cap B\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq A\\cap B\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}\">\\(\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"31b7e1fe9d49615e\" href=\"?note=31b7e1fe9d49615e\" title=\"67-df-faithful-interpretability\">67-df-faithful-interpretability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\Bigl[\\forall\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(A\\vdash\\pi\\Longrightarrow B\\vdash\\pi)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(B\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow A\\vdash\\sigma)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA\\unlhd_{\\mathrm f}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\Bigl[\\forall\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(A\\vdash\\pi\\Longrightarrow B\\vdash\\pi)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(B\\vdash\\sigma\\Longrightarrow A\\vdash\\sigma)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里恢复原书 Theorem 14 的双向后果条件：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 流向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 后果从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 流向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。不能仅由普通解释就断言忠实性。</p>\n<p>来源陈述已对照，并查看 PDF 第 95 页图像确认两个后果方向。原书 Theorem 14 依赖 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f5c44edc6c37ffdc\" href=\"?note=f5c44edc6c37ffdc\" title=\"67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion\">67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion</a>（Theorem 13）的忠实解释构造及前节 Theorem 6；本次核对陈述，未逐行重建第 85–87 页的 Henkin 构造。因此此原子是有精确来源的定理记录，不是本次独立补出的完整证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §2，Theorems 13–14，印刷页 84–87；PDF 第 95–98 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：仅核对 Theorem 14 陈述与依赖定位；第 85–87 页忠实 Henkin 构造未逐行核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-faithful-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"31b7e1fe9d49615e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-faithful-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-pi1","status":"resolved","id":"8b478f37907667f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locati